      "IN FLIGHT with the Flagship Fleet\nof AMERICAN AIRLINES, Inc.\nTHIS FLIGHT — marked out in pencil on the\nmap — is a fine example of the real way to travel.\nWith freedom from tipping, complimentary meals,\nand no \"extras,\n\" it's not hard to figure a saving of\nmoney as well as time.\nA-245-B PRINTED IN U. S. A.\nPOSTCARD\nWithin\nthe U.S.\nIc\nWithin\nCanada\nIc\nFromone Coun-\ntry to the\n2c\nother\n2015\n166"
